        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "In his second adventure James Pond must retrieve the toys Dr Maybe has stolen. Pond has been armed with an Inspector Gadget-style stretch device, which he can use to view higher areas or claw onto ceilings so as to slide across them.\n\nThe gameplay takes place across worlds themed around particular types of toys, such as sporting goods, candy and aircraft. The levels scroll sideways, although a small amount of vertical movement is included. On each level Pond must collect 2 penguins and reach the exit, although there are usually multiple exits and lots of secret areas to explore. After completing each pair of two worlds (each of which has three sub levels), a boss must be faced.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "En su segunda aventura, James Pond debe recuperar los juguetes que el Dr Maybe ha robado. Pond cuenta con un dispositivo extensible al estilo de Inspector Gadget, que puede usar para ver áreas más altas o aferrarse a los techos para deslizarse por ellos.\n\nLa jugabilidad transcurre en mundos temáticos basados en tipos particulares de juguetes, como artículos deportivos, dulces y aviones. Los niveles se desplazan lateralmente, aunque incluyen un pequeño movimiento vertical. En cada nivel, Pond debe recolectar 2 pingüinos y llegar a la salida, aunque normalmente hay varias salidas y muchas áreas secretas por explorar. Tras completar cada par de mundos (cada uno con tres subniveles), hay que enfrentarse a un jefe.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1991",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
