        },
        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "James Pond 3: Operation Starfish",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Unlike the first game of the series, that was a mission-based game, and the second one, where your character had unique abilities such as observing the whole level and growing to unlimited height, James Pond 3 is a standard jump and run platform game. Pond can run very quickly (by holding down the A button) through large levels, which often contain steep mountain sides and other tricky areas. Once again, he has to oppose the evil scientist Maybe and his minions.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "A diferencia del primer juego de la serie, que era un juego basado en misiones, y del segundo, en el que tu personaje tenía habilidades únicas como observar todo el nivel y crecer hasta alturas ilimitadas, James Pond 3 es un juego de plataformas de salto y carrera estándar. Pond puede correr muy rápido (manteniendo pulsado el botón A) a través de niveles grandes, que a menudo contienen laderas empinadas y otras zonas complicadas. Una vez más, debe enfrentarse al malvado científico Maybe y a sus secuaces.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1993",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
